           "kind": "text",
           "paragraphs": [
            {
             "role": "type.body",
             "text": "Six reference ranges built on one forecast, so a difference between them is a difference of method rather than of assumption."
            },
            {
             "role": "type.body",
             "text": "Trading comparables and precedent transactions set the floor; the discounted cash flow sets the case for waiting."
            },
            {
             "role": "type.body",
             "text": "The recommendation follows from where those ranges overlap, and from nothing else."
            },
            {
             "role": "type.body",
             "text": "Where the six disagree is method, not view: the discounted cash flow reaches higher only on a terminal growth assumption a strategic buyer will not underwrite, and the leveraged buy-out floor sits below every strategic method."
            }
           ]
          }
